{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Temporary Chat Flow — agreed\n\nSection-level chats; Keep then move before editing.\n\n[[Harness Design]]\n[[Run Lifecycle - Temporary Expiry.canvas]]\nTimer revised in D-048; cleanup proposed.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "temp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Temporary section-level chat\n\nReads permitted section/project context.\nNo durable memory or repo edits.\nTimer held full while working; one-hour countdown when idle/waiting.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## User requests repository edits\n\nTemporary cannot enter projects or edit the repo.\nEnd the active run with a transition-needed response before Keep/move approvals.",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "keep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Approval 1: Keep chat?\n\nBetween runs, ask to make this chat permanent.\nWait for a decision.\nKeeping alone grants no repository editing access.",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "kept",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Keep accepted\n\nRemove expiry in place.\nPreserve transcript under the same section.\nNormal memory eligibility begins.\nStill outside the project; repo remains read-only.",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Check normal movement rules\n\nDifferent source Closed section must become Shared first.\nCannot leave a repo-bound project.\nKeep approval does not bypass these rules.",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "move",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Approval 2: Move into project?\n\nAsk to move permanently into the target repo project.\nMake clear that this chat cannot leave that project afterward.",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "inside",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Move accepted and completed\n\nChat belongs to the project and fixed section.\nStart a new run with refreshed context.\nMembership grants repo read/write access without per-edit approval.",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "edit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Edit and show changes\n\nNo prompt for each repository edit.\nShow files changed and +/− line counts.\nOne run per repo project; its other chats queue.\nBoth approvals and move must succeed first.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "declinekeep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Keep declined\n\nRemain temporary in the section.\nRepository stays read-only.\nInactivity expiry still applies.",
      "x": 960,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "declinemove",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Move declined\n\nKeep already succeeded: remain a permanent section-level chat.\nRepository stays read-only.\nDo not silently restore temporary expiry.",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "blocked",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Movement not currently allowed\n\nDo not edit the target repository.\nExplain which section/project rule blocks entry.\nOpening a Closed section is a separate user action.",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
